2026-07-27T10:25:39.6358811Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T10:25:39.6359126Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T10:25:39.6359612Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T10:25:39.6360659Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T10:25:39.6361441Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
